# AmicaleStar - Jury Presentation Cheat Sheet

## 30-Second Elevator Pitch

**AmicaleStar** is a full-stack web application for managing student associations. It handles member registrations, activities, voting systems, and notifications. Built with **Angular 21 frontend** and **Spring Boot backend**, enabling administrators to efficiently manage operations while members enjoy a user-friendly interface.

**Tech Stack**: Angular | Spring Boot | PostgreSQL | WebSocket | JWT Authentication

