- **Frontend**: Angular 21, 12+ modules, ~50+ components
- **Backend**: Spring Boot, Microservices-ready architecture
- **Modules**: 8 major feature modules + core infrastructure
- **Users Types**: Adhérents (Members), Bureau (Admins), Admins
- **Features**: 15+ major features across registration, activities, voting, notifications

