## Technology Choices & Rationale

### Angular 21 - Why?
- Latest version with best practices
- Standalone components: simpler mental model
- Strong typing with TypeScript
- RxJS: reactive programming model
- Large ecosystem and community

### Spring Boot - Why?
- Convention over configuration
- Built-in security, testing, logging
- Microservices ready
- Spring Data JPA: reduced boilerplate
- Excellent tooling

### PostgreSQL - Why?
- ACID compliance: data reliability
- Advanced features: JSON, arrays, full-text search
- Scaling: replication, partitioning
- Cost effective: open-source

### JWT - Why?
- Stateless: no session storage needed
- Scalable: works with distributed systems
- Secure: cryptographically signed
- Self-contained: includes user info

### WebSocket - Why?
- Real-time bidirectional communication
- Lower latency than polling
- Connection reuse: more efficient
- Perfect for live notifications

